**Q4.** Placement before `need_file` is correct: [`gate_skip()`](C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lib.sh:137) preserves earlier failures. The block adds 29 successful checks. There is no gate-wide count pin to update; `run.sh` already includes gate 13, and `GATE_MANIFEST=16` counts gate scripts.

